A command whose broken holds a type error under a line directive naming a file
outside the tree. The report names the skip where the file writes it, and the
skip still holds broken.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//line ../nowhere/gen.go:10
func broken() int { return "x" }
